# Introduction

We use [NestJS](https://nestjs.com/) to structure our project. NestJS has an amazing documentation on how things should be created. Please take sometime to learn about [Modules, Controllers, Services](https://docs.nestjs.com/first-steps) before contributing to this project.

We keep all credentials and API documentations, request, examples in our Postman Works called `Curebase - Integrations API` . There you can hit the services directly using different credentials (dev / prod).

